flowchart TD
    %% DFD Level 1: Process 1.0 - User Management
    %% Shows decomposition of User Management into sub-processes
    
    %% External Entities
    SR[Sales Representative]
    PA[Pharmacist/Admin]
    SA[System Admin]
    
    %% Sub-Processes
    P1_1[1.1 Authenticate User<br/>Login & Session]
    P1_2[1.2 Register New User<br/>Account Creation]
    P1_3[1.3 Manage User Profile<br/>Update Profile]
    P1_4[1.4 Manage User Roles<br/>Role Assignment]
    P1_5[1.5 Track User Sessions<br/>Session Management]
    
    %% Data Stores
    D1[(D1: User Database<br/>Users, Profiles, Roles)]
    D2[(D2: User Session<br/>Active Sessions)]
    D17[(D17: Audit Log<br/>User Activities)]
    
    %% External Entity to Process Flows
    SR -->|Login Credentials| P1_1
    PA -->|Login Credentials| P1_1
    SA -->|Login Credentials| P1_1
    
    SR -->|Registration Data| P1_2
    PA -->|Registration Data| P1_2
    SA -->|User Creation| P1_2
    
    SR -->|Profile Updates| P1_3
    PA -->|Profile Updates| P1_3
    SA -->|Profile Updates| P1_3
    
    SA -->|Role Assignment| P1_4
    
    %% Process to Data Store Flows
    P1_1 -->|Validate Credentials| D1
    P1_1 -->|Create Session| D2
    P1_1 -->|Log Login| D17
    D1 -->|User Info| P1_1
    D2 -->|Session Info| P1_1
    
    P1_2 -->|Store User Data| D1
    P1_2 -->|Create Profile| D1
    P1_2 -->|Log Registration| D17
    D1 -->|Check Existing| P1_2
    
    P1_3 -->|Update Profile| D1
    P1_3 -->|Log Changes| D17
    D1 -->|Current Profile| P1_3
    
    P1_4 -->|Update Roles| D1
    P1_4 -->|Log Role Changes| D17
    D1 -->|User Roles| P1_4
    
    P1_5 -->|Update Session| D2
    P1_5 -->|Log Activity| D17
    D2 -->|Session Data| P1_5
    
    %% Process to Process Flows
    P1_1 -->|Session Created| P1_5
    P1_2 -->|User Created| P1_3
    
    %% Process to External Entity Flows
    P1_1 -->|Auth Status| SR
    P1_1 -->|Auth Status| PA
    P1_1 -->|Auth Status| SA
    P1_1 -->|Session Token| SR
    P1_1 -->|Session Token| PA
    P1_1 -->|Session Token| SA
    
    P1_2 -->|Registration Confirmation| SR
    P1_2 -->|Registration Confirmation| PA
    
    P1_3 -->|Profile Updated| SR
    P1_3 -->|Profile Updated| PA
    
    P1_4 -->|Role Updated| SA
    P1_4 -->|User List| SA
    
    P1_5 -->|Session Status| SR
    P1_5 -->|Session Status| PA
    P1_5 -->|Session Status| SA
    
    %% Styling
    classDef externalEntity fill:#e1f5ff,stroke:#0066cc,stroke-width:2px
    classDef process fill:#fff4e1,stroke:#ff6600,stroke-width:2px
    classDef dataStore fill:#e1ffe1,stroke:#00cc00,stroke-width:2px
    
    class SR,PA,SA externalEntity
    class P1_1,P1_2,P1_3,P1_4,P1_5 process
    class D1,D2,D17 dataStore

